Z||000000||Silver Bullet||02-07-2000||06:05 PM||||I am getting ready to sell my car so I can get a GT.  I was wondering how much you would pay for an 85 se.  V6, auto, air, pm, pw, 147,000 miles.  It runs good.  has polished aluminum 5 star american racing wheels, with bf goodrich tires.  It's silver, but the paint of the roof is a little faded.  It is a pretty nice car.  I paid 1,000 for it, but i have put alot into since then.  let me know what you think.  Thanks in advance||||reg||1
